title Resolve and Read One Turn (UC2) - Target / Pending implementation
participant "Mate" as Mate
participant "EventQuery" as Query
database "Events" as Events
database "Executions" as Exec
Mate -> Query : GET turn of sessionId + eventId, page, limit
Query -> Events : Read event by (sessionId, eventId)
Events --> Query : Event type and payload
Query -> Exec : Find execution by segment link or interrupt target
Exec --> Query : executionId, rootEventId, state
Query -> Events : Read linked events and stop event by eventSeq, limit + 1
Events --> Query : One page of committed events
Query -> Query : Project with shared CommittedEventProjection
Query --> Mate : rootEventId, finished, events, nextPage
